//   shadowTitle   title screen / menus / jukebox: 4-bar intro, then a 24-bar loop, full volume
//   shadowRun     in game, 24-bar loop, 60 % volume
//   shadowOver    game over sting (plays once), full volume
//
// Sound effects are one-track ATM_SFX_TRACKs for ATM.playSfx(). ATMlib has ONE effect slot: a new effect replaces the
// running one. The tonal effects use channel 1, the noise effects channel 3 (the song gives the channel back).

